THIRD-PARTY SAMPLE DATA

This repository redistributes third-party sample databases. They remain under
their own licences and are not covered by the licence above:

  Chinook  - https://github.com/lerocha/chinook-database
             MIT License. Copyright (c) Chinook Database ( originally
             developed by Michael Lidgard / "chinookdatabase.com" ).

  Sakila   - https://github.com/sakiladb/mysql and
             https://github.com/sakiladb/postgres
             Originally created by MySQL AB and released under the
             BSD 2-Clause License. Copyright (c) 2006, 2019 Oracle and/or
             its affiliates.

The patched copies under packs/ differ from the upstream releases only in
that statements which cannot execute inside a Docker container have been
removed (CREATE DATABASE / DROP DATABASE / psql "\c" / the SQL Server
"drop if exists" block) and line endings normalised to LF. The dataset
content is otherwise unmodified.
